==== Further hardware information ====
  * SoC/LAN: [[https://www.broadcom.com/products/Wireless-LAN/802.11-Wireless-LAN-Solutions/BCM4707-4708-4709 | Broadcom BCM4709 A0]] (1GHz dualcore ARM Cortex-A9 SoC)
  * SoC: [[https://www.broadcom.com/products/broadband-access-and-modems/broadband-carrier-access/bcm63168 | Broadcom BCM63168]] (400MHz dualcore MIPS SoC "with network acceleration hardware")
  * RAM (for BCM4709): {{media:datasheets:ram:consumer_ddr3_h5tq1g6_8_3efr_rev1.3_131101.pdf|SK hynix H5TQ1G63EFR-PBC}} (1Gb/128MiB DDR3-1600 11-11-11 SDRAM, 64M x 16 configuration)
  * RAM (for BCM63168): {{media:datasheets:ram:datasheet_38_2013-09-17_13-13-07.2_zentel-20130911.pdf|Zentel A3R12E40CBF}} (512Mb/64MiB DDR2 SDRAM)
  * Flash (for BCM4709): {{media:datasheets:flash:s25fl128s_256s_00.pdf|Spansion S25FL128S}} (FL128SAIF00, 128Mbit/16MiB)
  * SPI flash (for BCM63168): {{media:datasheets:flash:w25q64fv_revm_10202015.pdf|Winbond W25Q64FVSSIG}} (25Q64FVSIG, 64Mbit/8MiB)
  * SPI flash (for DSP DCX81AC0CFAE3FNC): {{media:datasheets:flash:w25q80bv.pdf|Winbond W25Q80BVSSIG}} (25Q80BVSIG, 8Mbit/1MiB)
  * WiFi: 2x [[https://www.broadcom.com/products/Wireless-LAN/802.11-Wireless-LAN-Solutions/BCM4360 | Broadcom BCM4360]]
  * Analog frontend/DSL modem IC: Broadcom BCM6306
  * DECT: DSP DCX81AC0CFAE3FNC
  * VoicePort IC: {{media:datasheets:pb_zl88601_602-jun12.pdf|Microsemi ZL88601}}


