==== Opening the case ====

**Note:** This will void your warranty!

To open the device, ​you first need remove ​the two screws which hide under the grey rubber feet at the lower edge of the case, then you need to pry off the top cover. Please note that the top cover consist of an outer piece of transparent plastic ​and an inner piece of white plastic which are glued together. When trying to pry open the case, it may seem as if you are only prying off the outer transparent piece, but eventually, both pieces will come off altogether. You need to exert a considerable amount of force, but you to *not* need any tools for the prying. Be aware that you *will* tear off 2-3 snap lugs when prying the case open, although these minuscule damages won't be visible from the outside and the case can still be properly closed afterwards.

